---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="FindPoise's privacy policy outlining how we respect and protect your data."
>
  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    FindPoise is a static editorial website. We do not require account registration, and we do not store personal financial data or passwords on our servers.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Cookies & Affiliate Tracking</h2>
  <p>
    When you click on an outbound affiliate link on FindPoise, a tracking cookie may be stored in your web browser by the respective affiliate network (such as Impact.com, ShareASale, CJ, or Amazon). This cookie tells the merchant that you were referred by FindPoise so that we can earn a small referral commission upon checkout. These cookies typically expire after 30 to 90 days.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Analytics & Performance</h2>
  <p>
    We may use lightweight, privacy-focused analytics tools (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) to measure aggregate page visits, top referral countries, and device types. No personally identifiable information (PII) is captured or sold.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions or data requests regarding our Privacy Policy, contact us at <code>privacy@findpoise.com</code>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
